10. At the out set, it is necessary to refer Section 110 and 122(1)(b) of Cr.P.C.
110. Security for good behaviour from habitual offenders - When an Executive Magistrate receives information that there is within his local jurisdiction a person who (a) is by habit a robber, house-breaker, thief, or forger, or (b) is by habit a receiver of stolen property knowing the same to have been stolen, or (c) habitually protects or harbours thieves, or aids in the concealment of disposal of stolen property,
